        {
          "id": "rec:1cn6hk",
          "html": "Being a female character to defeat <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sir_Leye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sir Leye</a> (this is not a safe death for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ironman_mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hardcore ironman</a> accounts).",
          "text": "Being a female character to defeat Sir Leye (this is not a safe death for hardcore ironman accounts).",
          "alternatives": []
        },
        {
          "id": "rec:1aj5hmd",
          "html": "Players are highly recommended to turn into a female character in order to complete the quest without difficulty. Alternatively, players may simply home teleport out of Sir Leye&#39;s room - however this can take a long time and can happen multiple times - as home teleporting won&#39;t reset your quest progress, allowing them to finish the quest while being a male character.",
